OL,3,GNEWSATeenager killed in Fraserburgh
OL,4,Amotorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old has died in a collision
OL,7,Fbetween the motorbike he was riding and
OL,8,Fanother vehicle in Aberdeenshire.
OL,10,FThe crash involving a Lexmoto LXR 125
OL,11,Fmotorbike and a Volkswagen Transporter
OL,12,Fhappened on Watermill Road,
OL,13,FFraserburgh, at about 15:10 on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FPolice Scotland said the teenager died
OL,17,Fat the scene of the collision. The
OL,18,Fdriver of the Volkswagen did not
OL,19,Frequire medical treatment.
OL,21,FThe road was closed and reopened at
OL,22,Faround 23:30.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
